    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><strong>Make bulk ordering faster and easier with Yay Bulk Order for WooCommerce.</strong></p>\n<p>Yay Bulk Order helps customers find products, select quantities, and add multiple items to their cart from a single product table. No more opening individual product pages just to place a large order.</p>\n<p>Designed for <strong>B2B wholesale stores, retailers, and WooCommerce shops with large product catalogs</strong>, Yay Bulk Order helps customers place bigger orders with fewer steps.</p>\n<p>👉 <a href=\"https://yaycommerce.com/yay-bulk-order-for-woocommerce/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">What&#8217;s in Yay Bulk Order Pro?</a></p>\n<h4>FREE FEATURES</h4>\n<p><strong>1. Product Table – Order Multiple Products from One Place</strong></p>\n<p>Display WooCommerce products in an organized table so customers can browse, select quantities, and add multiple products to their cart without visiting individual product pages.</p>\n<p>Ideal for wholesale catalogs, bulk purchases, and quick ordering.</p>\n<p><strong>2. Product Table Builder – Create and Reuse Custom Tables</strong></p>\n<p>Create, customize, and save product tables to reuse across your WooCommerce store.</p>\n<p>Build different ordering tables for different pages or shopping experiences without starting from scratch.</p>\n<p><strong>3. Columns Manager – Customize Your Product Table Layout</strong></p>\n<p>Control how product information appears in each table.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add or remove table columns.</li>\n<li>Rearrange columns to match your preferred layout.</li>\n<li>Customize column display for different devices.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. Ready-to-Use Product Table Templates</strong></p>\n<p>Get started quickly with two built-in templates:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Full Features Product Table:</strong> A comprehensive table layout for displaying product information and ordering options.</li>\n<li><strong>Simple Product Table:</strong> A streamlined layout for straightforward product selection and ordering.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Choose the layout that works best for your customers and customize it as needed.</p>\n<p><strong>5. Flexible Display Options</strong></p>\n<p>Place product tables where customers need them most.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Insert tables using a Gutenberg block.</li>\n<li>Embed tables using shortcodes.</li>\n<li>Display tables on pages, posts, and WooCommerce shop or archive pages.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>6. General &amp; Design Settings</strong></p>\n<p>Fine-tune your product tables to create a consistent shopping experience.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Configure quantity settings.</li>\n<li>Adjust table page size.</li>\n<li>Customize interface colors to match your store&#8217;s branding.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>WHO IS YAY BULK ORDER FOR?</h4>\n<p>Yay Bulk Order is especially useful for:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>B2B and wholesale stores:</strong> Help business customers purchase multiple products and quantities efficiently.</li>\n<li><strong>Retailers and distributors:</strong> Make it easier to order products from large catalogs.</li>\n<li><strong>Stores with frequent repeat orders:</strong> Use Pro purchase lists and CSV ordering to simplify recurring purchases.</li>\n<li><strong>Stores with product variations:</strong> Use Pro variant tables to streamline ordering across multiple variations.</li>\n<li><strong>Any WooCommerce store:</strong> Offer a convenient alternative to traditional product-by-product shopping.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>SIMPLIFY BULK ORDERING WITH YAY BULK ORDER</h4>\n<p>From flexible product tables to advanced purchase lists and CSV ordering, Yay Bulk Order helps you create a faster and more convenient WooCommerce purchasing experience.</p>\n<p>Start with the free product table builder and upgrade to Pro when your store needs more advanced bulk ordering features.</p>\n<h3>Source Code</h3>\n<p>This plugin ships compiled JavaScript and CSS in the <code>assets/dist/</code> folder. The human-readable source code of these files is public, and you can review, study and fork it:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/YayCommerce/YayBulkOrder\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://github.com/YayCommerce/YayBulkOrder</a></p>\n<h4>Compiled files and their source</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><code>assets/dist/blocks/product-table/</code> (Product Table block editor scripts and styles): <a href=\"https://github.com/YayCommerce/YayBulkOrder/tree/main/apps/blocks/src/product-table\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">apps/blocks/src/product-table</a></li>\n<li><code>assets/dist/blocks/common/</code> (Cart Summary block): <a href=\"https://github.com/YayCommerce/YayBulkOrder/tree/main/apps/blocks/src/common\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">apps/blocks/src/common</a></li>\n<li><code>assets/dist/product-table-store/</code> (Product Table frontend store): <a href=\"https://github.com/YayCommerce/YayBulkOrder/tree/main/apps/packages/product-table-store\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">apps/packages/product-table-store</a></li>\n<li><code>assets/dist/page-admin/</code> (admin app): <a href=\"https://github.com/YayCommerce/YayBulkOrder/tree/main/apps/app-admin/src\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">apps/app-admin/src</a></li>\n<li>Code shared by these files: <a href=\"https://github.com/YayCommerce/YayBulkOrder/tree/main/apps/packages/common\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">apps/packages/common</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>The blocks and the frontend store are built with <code>@wordpress/scripts</code> (webpack). The admin app is built with Vite.</p>\n<h4>Build from source</h4>\n<p>You need Node.js 24 and PNPM 11. Run these commands:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><code>git clone https://github.com/YayCommerce/YayBulkOrder.git</code></li>\n<li><code>cd YayBulkOrder</code></li>\n<li><code>pnpm install</code></li>\n<li><code>pnpm build</code> (builds the blocks and the frontend store)</li>\n<li><code>pnpm build:admin:lite</code> (builds the admin app)</li>\n</ol>\n<p>The compiled files go to <code>assets/dist/</code>.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory, or install Yay Bulk Order through the WordPress Plugins screen.</li>\n<li>Activate Yay Bulk Order.</li>\n<li>Open the plugin&#8217;s Product Table Builder.</li>\n<li>Create a product table using a built-in template or customize your own layout.</li>\n<li>Configure the columns, quantity settings, and design.</li>\n<li>Save your table and display it using a Gutenberg block or shortcode.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<h4>\nCan customers order multiple WooCommerce products at once?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. Yay Bulk Order lets customers select quantities and add multiple products to their cart from a single product table.</p>\n</p>\n<h4>\nCan I customize the product table?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. You can create and save product tables, customize columns, adjust settings, and choose from built-in templates.</p>\n</p>\n<h4>\nCan I display product tables on different pages?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. You can insert product tables using Gutenberg blocks or shortcodes on pages, posts, and WooCommerce shop or archive pages.</p>\n</p>\n<h4>\nCan customers order multiple variations of a product?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, with Yay Bulk Order Pro. The Variant Table feature allows customers to order multiple variations of the same product.</p>\n</p>\n<h4>\nCan customers upload CSV files to place bulk orders?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. Yay Bulk Order Pro includes Quick CSV Order, allowing customers to import product SKUs and quantities from a CSV file.</p>\n</p>\n<h4>\nCan wholesale customers save products for future orders?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. The Pro version includes Purchase Lists, allowing customers to save, manage, download, and reorder product lists.</p>\n</p>\n<h4>\nCan I add bulk ordering features to the WooCommerce My Account page?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. Yay Bulk Order Pro can add Purchase List and Quick Order features to the My Account area.</p>\n</p>\n<h4>\nIs Yay Bulk Order only for B2B wholesale stores?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>No. Although it is particularly useful for <a href=\"https://yaycommerce.com/yay-wholesale-b2b-for-woocommerce/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">B2B and wholesale ordering</a>, any WooCommerce store that wants to simplify multi-product purchases can benefit from Yay Bulk Order.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>Nov 15, 2026 &#8211; Version 1.0.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: A crash when other YayCommerce Pro plugins are active.</li>\n<li>Fixed: Table layout in classic themes such as width, images, checkboxes and mobile scroll.</li>\n<li>Fixed: Auto update on Pro version.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n<li>Added Product Table for ordering multiple products.</li>\n<li>Added Product Table Builder.</li>\n<li>Added customizable Columns Manager.</li>\n<li>Added Full Features and Simple Product Table templates.</li>\n<li>Added Gutenberg block and shortcode display options.</li>\n<li>Added general and design settings.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Create customizable WooCommerce product tables and let customers quickly order multiple products and quantities from one place.",
